174
00:08:01,640 --> 00:08:03,560
好啦 你爹棒呆了
Okay, fine, your dad is awesome.

175
00:08:10,940 --> 00:08:13,420
我们小蛋糕生意的预期增长比
Well, our projected cupcake business growth ratio

176
00:08:13,420 --> 00:08:15,520
虽然还没达到目标 但秋季马上要到了
isn't where I want it to be, but with autumn here,

177
00:08:15,520 --> 00:08:16,980
我们很看好要推出的新产品
We have a lot of hope in the launch

178
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,640
南瓜香料口味小蛋糕
of our new pumpkin spice flavor.

179
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,820
宝贝 我很爱你
Honey, I love you very much,

180
00:08:20,820 --> 00:08:22,140
但我们时间不多
but we're almost out of time,

181
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:24,580
我没时间听你多说小蛋糕了
and I can't talk anymore about cupcakes.

182
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,440
想听听你的意见嘛
Just wanted to pick your brain.

183
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,340
麦克斯 今天请你来
Now, Max, I asked you to meet me here today

184
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:30,580
是想请你帮我个忙
because I wanna ask you a favor.

185
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,160
是想我偷带东西进来吗
You want me to smuggle something in?

186
00:08:32,340 --> 00:08:33,840
还是要偷带出去 两项我都是高手
Something out? I'm good either way.

187
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,400
我想请你带卡洛琳去财产拍卖会
I want you to take Caroline to the estate auction.

188
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,560
老爸 不要
Daddy, no.

189
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:40,240
为什么要我去承受那些痛苦
Why would I put myself through that?

190
00:08:40,380 --> 00:08:42,320
去个大家都认识我的地方
Why would I ever go where everybody knows who I am

191
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:43,620
然后被众人讪笑吗
and be publicly humiliated?

192
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,960
我知道这事情很煎熬
I know it will be hard for you,

193
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,600
但我保证你会不虚此行
but I promise it'll be worth it.

194
00:08:47,020 --> 00:08:48,280
在拍卖会上
There's one thing at that auction

195
00:08:48,280 --> 00:08:49,920
有件我很在乎很想你拥有的东西
that I really care about that I want you to have.

196
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:50,900
什么东西
What?

197
00:08:51,540 --> 00:08:52,920
是我婴儿期的那幅画像吗
The painting of me as a baby?

198
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,500
还是那个根据我五岁时样子做的雕像
The sculpture of me as a five-year-old?

199
00:08:55,260 --> 00:08:56,780
或是按照我十四岁样子织的壁毯
the tapestry of me at 14?

200
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,840
我有张七岁时 被警察当犯人画的素描像
I have a pretty good police sketch of me at seven.

201
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,580
我想你们去拍卖会
I want you two to go there

202
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:05,320
买回你骑着栗宝得到的马术纪念杯
and get the loving cup you won jumping with chestnut.

203
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:07,360
我知道那奖杯对你多重要
I know how much that meant to you.

204
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:10,160
就算我能够忍受出席的痛苦
Even if I could bring myself to go through all that,

205
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:12,860
但我们真得省下每一分钱来用于生意
we need every penny we have for the cupcake business.

206
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,420
告诉我爸爸 麦克斯
Tell him, Max.

207
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:17,520
马丁 你知道我愿为你做任何事
Martin, you know I'd do anything for you.

208
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:18,880
任何事
Anything.

209
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,740
但我们俩真的一穷二白了
But it's true. We're broke.

210
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,920
-时间到了 -老爸 这是真的
- Time is up. - Seriously, daddy,

211
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:26,080
我用肥皂包装盒来当钱包呢
I use the box our soap comes in as a wallet.

212
00:09:27,940 --> 00:09:29,520
天啊 这也太凄凉心酸了
Man, that is hard to hear.

213
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:34,080
麦克斯 你也是我的好女孩吧
Max, you're my girl, right?

214
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:35,940
我是吗
Am I?

215
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,500
我希望你想办法弄回那个奖杯
I want you to find a way to get that cup.

216
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:43,000
无论她怎么抗拒 一定要买回来
No matter what she says, make sure she gets that cup.

217
00:09:43,580 --> 00:09:44,720
跟得上吗
You follow me?

218
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:46,200
你想我跟你进去啊
You want me to follow you?

219
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,700
狱方会允许我进去吗
Can I even go back there?

220
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:49,740
小姐 您不能
No, you can't, Miss.

221
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,860
哦 你是说跟上你的思维
Oh, follow you, like follow your thought.

222
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,880
那东西对她很重要
It's important for her,

223
00:09:54,880 --> 00:09:56,699
而且对你们都很重要
and it's important for the both of you

224
00:09:56,699 --> 00:09:59,200
对你们的未来很重要
For your futures, all right?

225
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:01,040
弄到那奖杯 回答我 我要你弄什么呢
Get the cup. What are you getting?

226
00:10:01,880 --> 00:10:03,120
那奖杯吗 马丁
The cup, Martin?

227
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,120
我爱你们 两个小甜心
I love you, sweethearts.

228
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:08,700
老爸我也爱你
Love you too, daddy.

229
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:10,840
别担心 我们会弄回那奖杯的
And don't worry, we'll get that cup.

230
00:10:11,940 --> 00:10:13,240
我才不会去买那奖杯
I'm not getting that cup.

231
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:16,020
什么 那你干嘛答应他你会买
What? Then why did you say you would?

232
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:18,040
不可以拒绝在坐牢的人啊
You can't tell a man in prison "no".

233
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,360
他会用皮带上吊的
He'll hang himself with his belt.

234
00:10:19,740 --> 00:10:21,040
你都碰过两次了
It happened to you twice already.

235
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,180
我们一定得去买回那个奖杯
We have to go get that cup.

236
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:23,740
为什么
Why?

237
00:10:25,220 --> 00:10:26,280
奖杯里有钱
There's money in the cup.

238
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:29,920
这话什么意思
What are you talking about?

239
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:32,100
他说你的未来需要那个奖杯
He said we needed it for our future,

240
00:10:32,100 --> 00:10:33,200
然后眨了眼
then he winked.

241
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,480
不是暗指有钱 就是他在对我放电
It was either that, or he was hitting on me,

242
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,860
坦白说 那样也不赖
which, I'm not gonna lie, I wouldn't hate.

243
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:40,700
他为什么要藏钱在奖杯里啊 神探南茜
How would he even hide money in a cup, Nancy Drew?

244
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:43,060
那纪念杯长什么样子
Well, what does a loving cup look like?

245
00:10:43,140 --> 00:10:44,180
跟保龄球奖杯差不多吗
Is it like a bowling trophy?

246
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:45,340
你居然贬低我的奖杯
How dare you.

247
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:48,520
是不是有个木头底座啦
Does it have, like, a wood base?

248
00:10:50,380 --> 00:10:53,040
没错了 我以前也藏大麻在我妈的奖杯底座
Yup, I used to hide my stash in my mother's bowling trophy,

249
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:55,120
你觉得一个能够想出方法
And you're telling me the man who invented a way

250
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,320
骗尽大半个纽约的天才
to defraud most of New York isn't as clever

251
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:59,300
想不到十二岁嗑药妹就能想出的法子吗
as a stoned 12-year-old with a butter knife?

252
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:02,580
他都不听我说小蛋糕
Well, it was weird how it was all about the cup

253
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:04,440
只顾着说奖杯 的确有点古怪
and so little about the pumpkin spice cupcake.

254
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,200
对吧
Right?

255
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:07,160
而且你觉得那位
And you don't think your father

256
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:08,980
愿意花钱来做你的雕像
who spent a fortune to turn you into a sculpture,

257
00:11:09,540 --> 00:11:12,120
可能还是裸体的老爸
presumably nude, wouldn't try to figure out a way

258
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,740
不会想办法给女儿留后路吗
to take care of his only daughter?

259
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:15,980
他是个犯罪天才
The man's a criminal genius,

260
00:11:15,980 --> 00:11:19,440
他想到这个替你未来留后路的方法
and he found a way to put money for your future in the cup,

261
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:21,980
所以他才要我千里迢迢地过来谈
and clearly, that's why he dragged me out to prison,

262
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,600
因为他知道你会听我的话
because he knows you'll do what I say

263
00:11:23,780 --> 00:11:24,740
因为我是你的老大
'cause I'm the boss of you,

264
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,240
而且很快还会升级到当你的继母
and pretty soon, I'm gonna be your stepmom.

265
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,460
你的意思我明白了
I hear what you're saying,

266
00:11:31,300 --> 00:11:33,080
但我有个重要的问题
but I just have one big question.

267
00:11:33,420 --> 00:11:34,380
要花多少钱来标这纪念杯吗
How much are we willing to bid?

268
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:36,220
不是 是我得易容
No, about my disguise.

269
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:39,040
我可以扮个褐法妞 但要留刘海吗
I know I'm a brunette, but do I have bangs?

270
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,960
我要两份 一份给我
Actually, I need two: one for me,

271
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:48,880
一份给我的朋友佐伊·丹斯切尔
and one for my friend Zooey Deschanel.

272
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:53,140
-干嘛 你看起来像她啊 -谁不像她啊
- What? You look like her. - Everybody does.

273
00:11:53,200 --> 00:11:55,260
最省置装费 又有人愿意"睡"的打扮了
It's the least expensive look you can do and still get laid.

274
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:00,480
这些是储物间里的东西 都好多年没见到了
God, this is from storage. I haven't seen it in years.

275
00:12:00,900 --> 00:12:02,200
你们拥有这些衣柜
Wow, you had all these closets,

276
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,640
你们家族里真的没人是基佬吗
and no one in your family is gay?

277
00:12:05,360 --> 00:12:09,080
这路易十六的衣柜 以前是放在我的游戏房的
Look! It's the Louie the XVI I used to have in my playroom.

278
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:11,620
以前我都跟我表弟彼得一起爬进去
My cousin Peter and I used to climb in here

279
00:12:11,620 --> 00:12:12,840
然后重演法国大革命
and play French Revolution.

280
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,400
我扮演玛丽·安托瓦内特
I'd be Marie Antoinette,

281
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:16,360
然后他会帮我把头发弄上假髻
and he'd help me put my hair up in a high chignon.

282
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:19,740
我突然觉得他老婆好可怜啊
Oh, now I'm feeling bad for his wife.

283
00:12:22,040 --> 00:12:23,440
那个奖杯会放哪里呢
So where do you think the cup is?

284
00:12:23,620 --> 00:12:24,780
看看那边吧
Let's look over there.

285
00:12:26,900 --> 00:12:29,160
这是避暑别墅的东西
Oh, this is from the summer house.

286
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:31,280
麦克斯 你听过有句话叫
Max, you know the expression

287
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,920
"含着银汤匙出生吗"
"born with a silver spoon in your mouth"?

288
00:12:34,100 --> 00:12:35,240
这是我的
This is mine.

289
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,880
小姐 请勿触碰
Miss, do not handle that.

290
00:12:37,900 --> 00:12:39,440
请您立刻放下
I'm asking you to put it down right now.

291
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,740
你最好注意一下你的态度
Hey, you might wanna relax the attitude.

292
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:44,920
你觉得我朋友 詹妮弗·洛芙·休伊特
You really think my friend Jennifer Love Hewitt,

293
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:48,242
这位国际电影明星与生活台巨星
international movie and LifeTime channel superstar,

294
00:12:48,242 --> 00:12:49,598
会偷人家用过的汤匙吗
is gonna steal a used spoon?

295
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:51,860
抱歉 前面没认出来
Sorry, I didn't recognize you.

296
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,040
现在认出来了
Now I see it.

297
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:57,280
我不是佐伊·丹斯切尔吗
I thought I was Zooey Deschanel.

298
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:58,400
半斤八两啦
Eh, six of one.

299
00:12:58,460 --> 00:12:59,880
好莱坞褐发女星都长得差不多
All you hollywood brunettes look alike.

300
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:03,560
先生女士们 拍卖会即将开始
The auction is starting, ladies and gentlemen.

301
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,000
你好吗 麦克斯
Hi, Max.

302
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:07,900
好高兴来这里
I'm so excited to be here.

303
00:13:08,420 --> 00:13:09,900
你好 卡洛琳
Oh, hello, Caroline .

304
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:13,080
苏菲 我为我那天的行为道歉
Sophie, I apologize for the other day.

305
00:13:13,100 --> 00:13:15,320
我那时心情太紧张了 不是有意的
I was really tense, and I didn't mean it.

306
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:17,420
我觉得你的风格十分独特
I think you have a unique sense of style.

307
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:19,880
少少的布料 大大的美丽
You do so much with so little fabric.

308
00:13:20,980 --> 00:13:22,020
的确
I do...

309
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:28,080
看来你听我的话 去看波兰版《时尚》杂志啦
And I see you took my advice and got Polish Vogue.

310
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:30,900
这样真好
How nice is this?

311
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,820
我们终于开始浪漫约会
We are finally on a romantic date.

312
00:13:33,140 --> 00:13:34,980
我们刚在高档餐厅吃完饭
We just came from lunch at Rainbow Room,

313
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,620
我也穿着我最好的一件飞乐运动服
And I'm wearing my best Fila tracksuit.

314
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:41,460
现在他要买金闪闪的东西给我了
Yah, now, he's going to buy me something golden.

315
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,600
没错 我就想要全身被黄金覆盖
Yah, I want to be covered in gold.

316
00:13:44,840 --> 00:13:46,200
想要个黄金淋浴
I want a golden shower.

317
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:53,080
想想 如果我是个纪念杯
Let's see. If I was a loving cup,

318
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:54,340
我会在哪里
where would I be?

319
00:13:54,500 --> 00:13:57,080
某个你体内被塞了很多钞票的地方
Some place with a lot of cash shoved up inside you.

320
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,640
你觉得里面会有多少钱啊
How much do you think is in there?

321
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:01,160
看嘛 奖杯的木头底座大概这么大
Well, let's see. The wooden base of the cup is about this big,

322
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:03,780
你可以在口香糖罐里塞2万
and I know you can get 20,000 in an Altoids tin,

323
00:14:04,380 --> 00:14:06,440
而这底座有它的三倍的大
and this is about three times that size,

324
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,960
就表示装了6万吧
So 60,000.

325
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,220
就跟一百万一样多啊
That's like a million dollars!

326
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:18,600
再一个小时 我就有6万块了吗
So I could have $60,000 in an hour?

327
00:14:18,920 --> 00:14:21,120
是我们 我们就有
Well, we. We could have it.

328
00:14:21,720 --> 00:14:23,640
我说了"我"吗 真奇怪
Did I say I? How weird.

329
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:32,440
成交
And sold.

330
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:34,300
东西都被你买走啦
Wow, you're getting everything.

331
00:14:34,620 --> 00:14:35,660
是啊 都被我们买走了
Yes, we are.

332
00:14:36,420 --> 00:14:37,840
对不对啊 泡菜小姐
Aren't we, Miss Pickle?

333
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:40,340
我叫哈米斯·麦克唐纳
I'm Hamish Mcdonough, by the way.

334
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,580
我叫麦克斯 她是我朋友凯蒂·赫尔姆斯
Oh, I'm Max, and this is my friend Katie Holmes.

335
00:14:45,220 --> 00:14:47,920
我们不会说出去的
We won't speak of it...

336
00:14:48,780 --> 00:14:51,640
不过我想说 离得好
But I just have to say: well done!

337
00:14:53,700 --> 00:14:57,360
如果哪天你需要什么 千万别客气
And if you ever need anything, don't hesitate.

338
00:14:57,780 --> 00:14:59,520
你有自己的店啊
Oh, you have your own shop?

339
00:14:59,740 --> 00:15:01,520
"二人世界"古董店
"Just the two of us" Antiques.

340
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:03,060
是你跟泡菜小姐吗
Is that you and Miss Pickle?

341
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,660
亲爱的 我又不是疯子
No, dear, I'm not insane.

342
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,760
下一件要拍卖的物品
Next item for auction:

343
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:13,520
十九世纪的象牙黄金床边小桌
A 19th century ivory and gold bedside table,

344
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,040
再说一次
Oh, say it again.

345
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,920
有点不一般的要求 不过我再说一遍
This is highly unorthodox, but I shall repeat the item.

346
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:26,780
十九世纪的象牙黄金床边小桌
A 19th century gold and ivory bedside table--

347
00:15:29,500 --> 00:15:31,840
我是个"性"福的男人 对吧
I'm a very lucky man, yes?

348
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,800
这间物品的起标价是
We start the opening bid on this item

349
00:15:34,800 --> 00:15:36,700
5万块
at $50,000.

350
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:37,660
我退出
I'm out.

351
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,200
-5万 -这里
- 50,000. - Here.

352
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:42,699
有人出6万吗
Do I hear 60,000?

353
00:15:42,699 --> 00:15:44,607
-6万 -这位先生出6万
- 60,000! - 60,000 over here.

354
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:46,240
-有人愿意出7万吗 -我
- Do I hear 70,000? - Here.

355
00:15:46,279 --> 00:15:48,360
-7万 -有人要出8万吗
- 70,000. - Do I hear 80,000?

356
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,600
有的 我出
Yes, you do!

357
00:15:51,020 --> 00:15:54,160
8万一次 两次
80,000 going once, going twice,

358
00:15:54,540 --> 00:15:54,920
成交
Sold.

359
00:15:55,620 --> 00:15:57,141
哈米斯 你威震全场啊
Hamish, you killed it.

360
00:15:57,141 --> 00:15:59,013
那是哟
Yolo!

361
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,800
下一件要拍卖的物品
And the next item up for bid

362
00:16:02,800 --> 00:16:04,940
是一个镀银锡制纪念杯
is a silver-plated tin loving cup,

363
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,400
卡洛琳·钱宁所拥有过的物品
Property of Caroline Channing.

364
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,020
你觉得这东西会喊到多高的价
How much do you think this is going to go for?

365
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:12,360
这类东西起伏大 但本身都没实际价值
Kitsch is always a wild card, but it has no real value.

366
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:14,460
没实际价值 拜托哦
No real value? Please.

367
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:16,380
那我是在没人看好的情况下赢来的
I won that when no one thought I could.

368
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:19,520
我身染肺炎 雨中骑栗宝跳过十四个栅栏
I jumped 14 hurdles in the rain with walking pneumonia.

369
00:16:19,900 --> 00:16:20,920
这可是相当价值的
It's worth something.

370
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,620
是啊 价值来自里面的钞票
Yeah, 'cause it has money in it.

371
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:25,620
起标价50块
We start the bidding at $50.

372
00:16:29,940 --> 00:16:32,180
先生 加价幅度是10块钱
Sir, it's in increments of $10.

373
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,720
那我退出
Then, I'm out.

374
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:38,120
抱歉嘛 吃高档餐厅把我的钱都榨干了
Sorry, the Rainbow Room really sucked me dry.

375
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:41,300
你猜猜我身上现在哪里也很"干"
Hm, guess what else is pretty dry right now?

376
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,420
有人出60吗
Do I hear 60?

377
00:16:46,160 --> 00:16:48,260
你在干嘛 你不是说不值钱吗
What are you doing? You said it had no real value.

378
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:50,280
是啊 但你想象一下
I know, but wouldn't it be camp

379
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:52,420
拍一张泡菜小姐用奖杯洗澡的照片
to see Miss Pickle taking a bath in that

380
00:16:52,420 --> 00:16:53,620
来当圣诞卡 一定超可爱
for my christmas card?

381
00:16:53,920 --> 00:16:55,560
有人出70吗
Do I hear 70?

382
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:57,520
我的奖杯不是狗狗的澡盆
My cup is not a puppy bath.

383
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:01,980
放弃吧小姐们 我乃竞价小贱哥
Back out now, ladies. I'm a paddle bitch.

384
00:17:02,780 --> 00:17:04,800
我还是贱人贱贱姐呢 100
Well, I'm a bitch bitch. 100.

385
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:09,780
-175 -哈米斯想斗
- 175. - Hamish came to play.

386
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:12,420
我们斗死他 我处女膜是练马给练没了的呢
So did we, I broke my hymen getting that thing.

387
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,560
所以才叫纪念杯吗
Is that why it's called a loving cup?

388
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:18,540
200 我出200
200. I have 200.

389
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:20,120
有人出225吗
Do I hear 225?

390
00:17:20,220 --> 00:17:20,960
听我说 哈米斯
Look, Hamish.

391
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:23,200
我知道你对我平常拿来说服人的"本钱"
I know you have no interest in what I would normally

392
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,280
没有兴趣
offer you to get what I want.

393
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:27,420
话别说太早 62岁前我一直"男女通吃"
Don't be so sure. I was bisexual till I was 62.

394
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:31,320
凯蒂·赫尔姆斯真的很想要这东西
Look, Katie Holmes really wants this,

395
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:32,420
你看她经历了那么多苦难
and she's been through a lot.

396
00:17:33,020 --> 00:17:35,380
好吧 你们拿去 我退出
True. It's yours. I'm out.

397
00:17:35,900 --> 00:17:38,160
200块一次 两次
200 going once, going twice.

398
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,160
成交 爽啊 我有钱啦
Sold. Yes, I'm rich!

399
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:42,040
你又说了"我"吗
Did you just say "I'm"?

400
00:17:44,820 --> 00:17:46,760
是你听错了吧
I think you're hearing me wrong.

401
00:17:48,460 --> 00:17:50,580
在我们把钱花在生意之前
Okay, before we use all this money on the business,

402
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:52,900
先去度个假吧 你说如何
we should take a vacation. How 'bout it?

403
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:54,900
你 我 栗宝 水上摩托车
You, me, Chestnut, jet skis.

404
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,520
拿出来吧
Okay, here we go.

405
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:58,620
别别别 别现在打开
No, no, no. Don't open it now.

406
00:17:58,680 --> 00:17:59,600
这里有摄像头
There are cameras here.

407
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:01,160
那我们去那边打开吧
We can just go over there and open it

408
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:02,159
就去你跟你的娘炮亲戚
Right next to that thing where you

409
00:18:02,159 --> 00:18:04,580
玩变装游戏的那衣柜旁边
and your little queen cousin played dress-up.

410
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:06,320
说真的 我当年怎么没看出来
Seriously, how could I not have known that?

411
00:18:06,440 --> 00:18:07,760
我们玩牛仔大战印第安人
When we played cowboys and Indians,

412
00:18:07,760 --> 00:18:09,987
他总是扮演印第安化妆师
he played the Indian's makeup artist.

413
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,020
我得说 麦克斯
I have to say, Max,

414
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:13,820
能在拥有一点钱真的很开心
it'll be nice to have some money again,

415
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:16,780
但更开心的是 你看到了我爸的为人
but what's really nice is that now you see who my father is,

416
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:18,500
一个虽然有不少缺点
a man who, despite all of his flaws,

417
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,260
但是总是想方设法
never stopped thinking about what he could do

418
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:21,600
照顾他宝贝女儿的好父亲
to take care of his little girl.

419
00:18:28,500 --> 00:18:29,300
居然是空的
It's empty?

420
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,060
那个老混蛋
Son of a bitch.

421
00:18:33,980 --> 00:18:35,920
马丁 我们有个问题
Martin, we just have one question.

422
00:18:37,900 --> 00:18:38,500
钱呢
Where's the money?

423
00:18:40,090 --> 00:18:42,016
抱歉 你说什么
I'm sorry, what?

424
00:18:43,180 --> 00:18:44,600
钱 在哪里
Where's...the money?

425
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:47,720
什么
What?

426
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:49,740
她再问你钱藏哪去了
She's asking where the money is.

427
00:18:51,100 --> 00:18:52,260
哦 什么钱啊
Oh! Uh, what money?

428
00:18:52,460 --> 00:18:53,680
奖杯里的钱啊 老爸
The money in the cup, daddy.

429
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:56,520
你为我的未来所预留的钱啊
The money you hid in the cup that was supposed to be for my future?

430
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,820
我的6万块在哪里
Where's my 60 grand?

431
00:18:57,980 --> 00:19:00,380
给所有可能在读我唇的人
Which, for anyone who might be watching my lips,

432
00:19:00,380 --> 00:19:02,220
我们是要拿那笔钱去做公益
we were going to give all to charity.

433
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:05,400
宝贝 你怎么会觉得我有藏钱呢
Sweetheart, why do you think I would hide money,

434
00:19:05,660 --> 00:19:07,200
虽然我被关就是因为藏了钱
Besides the fact I'm here for hiding money?

435
00:19:08,140 --> 00:19:09,520
这可能是我的错
Well, that might have been my fault.

436
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:11,700
老爸 这不是她的错
No, it's not her fault, daddy.

437
00:19:11,720 --> 00:19:12,480
是你的
It's yours.

438
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:14,860
你本应该好好照顾我 可你却没有
You were supposed to take care of me, and you didn't.

439
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,780
你从没为我想过
You didn't think about me at all,

440
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:19,500
不只是我 你伤了那么多人
And it's not just me. You hurt a lot of people.

441
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:20,980
你想过他们的感受吗
Do you ever even think about them?

442
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,160
有啊
Yes, I do.

443
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:25,080
我现在每日每夜地想
Now, every day,

444
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,920
但我也想到我对你做的那些事
but I also think about what I did to you

445
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,120
整天都在想
every day, all day.

446
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:31,100
我是说 以前
I mean, back then,

447
00:19:31,100 --> 00:19:33,080
当我知道如何捞不劳而获的钱时
when I figured out a way to get free money,

448
00:19:33,260 --> 00:19:35,260
我脑子里想的全是钱
all I could think about was the money.

449
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:36,520
嗯哼
I hear that.

450
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:40,800
可我是真心想送你的未来一份礼 宝贝
But I really did wanna give you something for your future, sweetheart,

451
00:19:41,420 --> 00:19:43,720
所以我才请麦克斯来确保
which is why I asked Max to make sure

452
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:44,980
你会拿到那个奖杯
that you got that cup.

453
00:19:45,740 --> 00:19:46,560
虽然只是个锡奖杯
And I know it's only tin,

454
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,880
但那是我能给你最有价值的东西了
but it's the most valuable thing I could give you,

455
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:50,760
因为它能提醒你
because it'll remind you

456
00:19:50,760 --> 00:19:53,020
无论境况有多糟糕
that no matter how hard the circumstances,

457
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:56,580
你都能跨过任何的难关
you could get over any hurdle,

458
00:19:57,420 --> 00:20:00,120
即便是我给你带来的困境 你也能大步跨过
even the ones I put in front of you.

459
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:04,080
好吧 我们该走了 时间到了
Okay, well, we should go. Our time's up.

460
00:20:04,080 --> 00:20:05,860
这么快要走啊 你才刚到呢
Yeah, but--what? You just got here.

461
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:07,860
我今天已经听够了
Well, I think I'm done for today.

462
00:20:11,620 --> 00:20:14,900
我一直都害怕有天你会用这眼神看我
Boy, I've dreaded the day you looked at me like this.

463
00:20:15,900 --> 00:20:17,360
今天真的看到了 比我想象中还难受
Now that it's here, it's even worse.

464
00:20:19,760 --> 00:20:21,380
我只希望有一天
I only hope that one day

465
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:22,560
你会换个眼神看我
you could look at me again

466
00:20:22,560 --> 00:20:24,420
用你赢得奖杯那时的眼神看我
the way you did the day you won that cup.

467
00:20:32,400 --> 00:20:33,540
宝贝 我爱你
I love you, honey.

468
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:35,240
老爸 我也爱你
I love you too, daddy.

469
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:39,160
抱歉
Oh. Sorry.

470
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:40,500
你是对她说
You meant her.

471
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:43,140
下周见吗
See you next week?

472
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:52,500
有老爸的日子也不好过呀
Wow, having a father is rough.

473
00:20:54,100 --> 00:20:56,380
-你没事吧 -会没事的
- Are you okay? - I will be,

474
00:20:57,020 --> 00:20:59,060
无论其他人怎么想
Because despite what everyone else may think,

475
00:20:59,180 --> 00:21:01,140
他都不止是个贼 他是我的父亲
he's not just a thief. He's my father,

476
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:02,600
我爱他
And I love him.

477
00:21:03,420 --> 00:21:04,840
不知道这能不能让你觉得安慰
Look, if it's any consolation,

478
00:21:04,840 --> 00:21:06,800
但我看出他为何会有今日了
I now see how that could've happened to him.

479
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:07,860
我不会原谅他
I'm not condoning it,

480
00:21:07,860 --> 00:21:09,560
只是我懂为何别人会被拐了
but I see how people can get caught up,

481
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:11,600
但我还在生气 气下周
'cause I am pissed as hell that next week
